{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09650","headline":"江上阻风雨 · 岑参","name":"江上阻风雨","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"江上风欲来，泊舟未能发。\n气昏雨已过，突兀山复出。\n积浪成高丘，盘涡爲嵌窟。\n云低岸花掩，水涨滩草没。\n老树蛇蜕皮，崩崖龙退骨。\n平生抱忠信，艰险殊可忽。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09650.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09650","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}